{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：21:20 2026-11-26 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"深井浪翠園97蟹貨業主長揸30年 慘蝕242萬離場 換樓客688萬購全海景戶\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1d0dc98fdc04f09985aad6acb56424c5/2026-11/KF_Christine_71_.png\"/>\n<p>深井浪翠園錄得「97蟹貨」蝕讓成交。晉誠地產分行高級營業經理李德鴻表示，屋苑2期6座中層B室，實用面積802方呎，原則3房1套連儲物室間隔，附設露台，坐向西南，享全海景，新近以688萬元易手，實用呎價約8,579元。</p>\n<h3>2期6座中層B室：</h3>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d55d062dfe76c1e5e5abfe59a2ccc77d/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-26_at_21_02_58_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bca9779d42ea08d3e240dc4976af08e3/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-26_at_21_02_58.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/eb2b94302178df28b28c22c1939975c5/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-26_at_21_02_57.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/89877562075fb55400d7da513f4fc2d1/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-26_at_21_02_59_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/26c2172de45fca816a0d8add049b3c5f/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-26_at_21_02_59.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f0924594fcd471e210da4571cac99f1e/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-26_at_21_02_59_3_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ccb04299fe89b28294bb7363748762a0/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-26_at_21_02_59_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<p>李德鴻指出，新買家為外區換樓客，在市場物色換樓盤源已多月，一直心水鎖定浪翠園2期6座享有全海景的B室優質戶型，惟同類放盤極度罕有、市場長期缺貨。剛好原業主於本月初剛以698萬元放售，買家見狀「一睇即合」，隨即洽購睇樓及議價，並獲微減10萬元，終以688萬元承接奪得心頭好。</p>\n<p>據了解，原業主早於1997年5月樓市高峰期以930萬元購入上址，持貨長達29年半，是次轉手帳面仍需大幅蝕讓242萬元，蝕幅約26%。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T13:44:11.443167+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":348,"images":8,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T13:20:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T23:37:52.028641+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T13:37:27.113858+00:00","content_hash":"028f49a6989071c60e8c057dd4f3addfb16aa2f9ecd003dce0344a8f4328108c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}